{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type MediaPromptFor<TModalities> = \n  | string\n  | (\n  | TextPart\n  | MediaPartByModality[TModalities])[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2130","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2130"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prompt type narrowed to the modalities a specific model supports.\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MediaPromptFor<never>"},{"type":"text","value":" (a text-only model) is "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string | Array<TextPart>"},{"type":"text","value":";\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MediaPromptFor<'image'>"},{"type":"text","value":" additionally admits image parts, etc. Used by\nthe activity option types together with the adapter's per-model input\nmodality map so unsupported parts fail at compile time."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tmodalities","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TModalities"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TModalities"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"MediaPromptModality.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MediaPromptModality"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"never"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tmodalities","text":"TModalities","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype MediaPromptFor<TModalities> = \n  | string\n  | (\n  | TextPart\n  | MediaPartByModality[TModalities])[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2130](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2130)\n\nPrompt type narrowed to the modalities a specific model supports.\n`MediaPromptFor<never>` (a text-only model) is `string | Array<TextPart>`;\n`MediaPromptFor<'image'>` additionally admits image parts, etc. Used by\nthe activity option types together with the adapter's per-model input\nmodality map so unsupported parts fail at compile time.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TModalities\n\n`TModalities` *extends* [`MediaPromptModality`](MediaPromptModality.md) = `never`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: MediaPromptFor\ntitle: MediaPromptFor\n---\n\n```ts\ntype MediaPromptFor<TModalities> = \n  | string\n  | (\n  | TextPart\n  | MediaPartByModality[TModalities])[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2130](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2130)\n\nPrompt type narrowed to the modalities a specific model supports.\n`MediaPromptFor<never>` (a text-only model) is `string | Array<TextPart>`;\n`MediaPromptFor<'image'>` additionally admits image parts, etc. Used by\nthe activity option types together with the adapter's per-model input\nmodality map so unsupported parts fail at compile time.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TModalities\n\n`TModalities` *extends* [`MediaPromptModality`](MediaPromptModality.md) = `never`\n"}
